function breadcrumbs(){const [r,sub]=route();const names={ordinary:'普通产品申报',period:'系列内产品申报',series:'滚存系列管理',query:'申报查询',product:'申报详情',issuance:'发行管理',issue:'发行办理',workbench:'工作台'};if(r==='workbench')return `<span>存款经营平台</span>${icon('chevron')}<b>工作台</b>`;let parts=['结构性存款管理'];if(!['issuance','issue'].includes(r))parts.push('产品申报管理');if(['series','period'].includes(r))parts.push('滚存产品申报');parts.push(names[r]||'工作台');if(sub==='new')parts.push('新增');return parts.map((p,i)=>`${i?icon('chevron'):''}<${i===parts.length-1?'b':'span'}>${p}</${i===parts.length-1?'b':'span'}>`).join('');}
function shell(content){const [r]=route();const nav=(label,to,ic='',cls='')=>`<a class="nav-row ${(r===to||(r==='product'&&to==='query')||(r==='issue'&&to==='issuance'))?'current':''} ${cls}" href="#${to}">${ic?icon(ic):''}<span>${label}</span></a>`;return `<aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="#workbench"><span class="brand-mark">存</span><div><strong>存款经营平台</strong></div></a><div class="nav-scroll"><div class="nav-section">工作空间</div>${nav('工作台','workbench','grid','primary')}<div class="nav-section">业务管理</div><button class="nav-row primary active" data-action="toggle-nav" aria-expanded="true">${icon('bank')}<span>结构性存款管理</span><span class="arrow">${icon('down')}</span></button><div class="nav-sub" id="businessNav">${role!=='branch'?`<button class="nav-row" data-action="toggle-sub" aria-expanded="true">产品申报管理<span class="arrow">${icon('down')}</span></button><div class="nav-sub">${nav('普通产品申报','ordinary')}<button class="nav-row" data-action="toggle-sub" aria-expanded="true">滚存产品申报<span class="arrow">${icon('down')}</span></button><div class="nav-sub">${nav('滚存系列管理','series')}${nav('系列内产品申报','period')}</div>${nav('申报查询','query')}</div>`:''}${nav('发行管理','issuance')}</div><div class="nav-section">平台扩展</div><div class="nav-row muted" style="font-size:11px;color:#6b8593">${icon('grid')}其他业务模块预留</div></div></aside><main class="main"><header class="topbar"><button class="toolbar-icon mobile-menu" data-action="mobile-menu" aria-label="展开菜单">${icon('menu')}</button><div class="breadcrumb">${breadcrumbs()}</div><div class="top-actions"><button class="toolbar-icon" data-action="help" aria-label="使用帮助">${icon('help')}</button><div class="role-switch"><span class="avatar">${role==='manager'?'经':role==='reviewer'?'核':'分'}</span><select id="roleSelect" aria-label="当前角色">${Object.entries(ROLES).map(([v,n])=>`<option value="${v}" ${v===role?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div></header><div class="page">${content}</div></main>`;}
function title(h,sub='',actions='',eye=''){return `<div class="page-title"><div><h1>${h}</h1><p class="subtitle">${sub}</p></div>${actions?`<div class="title-actions">${actions}</div>`:''}</div>`;}
function empty(h='暂无记录',text='调整筛选条件，或发起一笔新的产品申报。'){return `<div class="empty">${icon('archive')}<h3>${h}</h3><div>${text}</div></div>`;}
function stats(items){return `<div class="stats">${items.map(([n,v,h,i])=>`<div class="stat"><div class="stat-name">${n}</div><div class="stat-icon">${icon(i)}</div><div class="stat-number">${v}<span style="font-size:11px;color:#acb5ba;margin-left:7px;letter-spacing:0">笔</span></div><small>${h}</small></div>`).join('')}</div>`;}
function productTable(products,{compact=false,paginate=true}={}){if(!products.length)return empty();const pages=Math.ceil(products.length/8);pageNum=Math.min(Math.max(pageNum,1),pages);const visible=paginate?products.slice((pageNum-1)*8,pageNum*8):products;return `<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>产品名称 / 申报编号</th><th>产品类型</th>${compact?'':'<th>产品期限</th><th>额度（万元）</th>'}<th>申报状态</th><th>${compact?'当前环节':'最近更新'}</th><th style="text-align:right">操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>${visible.map(p=>`<tr><td><div class="product-cell"><span class="product-icon ${p.type==='rolling'?'rolling':''}">${icon(p.type==='rolling'?'repeat':'file')}</span><div><a href="#product/${esc(p.id)}" class="product-name">${esc(p.name)}</a><div class="subline">${esc(p.id)}</div></div></div></td><td>${p.type==='rolling'?'滚存产品':'普通产品'}${p.type==='rolling'?`<div class="subline">${esc(p.seriesId)} · 第 ${esc(p.period)} 期</div>`:''}</td>${compact?'':`<td>${esc(p.tenor||'—')}<span class="muted"> 天</span></td><td>${money(p.quota)}</td>`}<td>${badge(p)}</td><td>${compact?`<span class="muted">${taskText(p)[0]}</span>`:`<span class="muted">${esc(p.updated)}</span>`}</td><td style="text-align:right">${link(compact?'去办理':'查看详情',`product/${p.id}`,'text-button')}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>${paginate?`<div class="pagination"><span>共 ${products.length} 笔申报 · 每页 8 笔</span><div class="pages">${btn('‹','prev-page','small','','aria-label="上一页" '+(pageNum===1?'disabled':''))}${Array.from({length:pages},(_,i)=>`<button class="page-num ${pageNum===i+1?'active':''}" data-action="page" data-page="${i+1}">${i+1}</button>`).join('')}${btn('›','next-page','small','','aria-label="下一页" '+(pageNum===pages?'disabled':''))}</div></div>`:''}`;}
function taskText(p){return {draft:['完善申报','填写产品要素后提交复核。'],returned:['补充修改',p.history.find(h=>['退回修改','业务要素调整'].includes(h.action))?.note||'请按处理意见修改后重新提交。'],review:['产品复核','复核岗确认申报要素，可通过或退回修改。'],market:['金市配置','等待金市系统完成产品配置，并回传最终要素和产品说明书。'],check:['一致性校验','比对已复核申报、金市最终要素及说明书。'],difference:['处理要素差异','差异解决前不能生成发行材料。业务要素调整后须重新复核。'],ready:['准备发行','一致性校验已通过，可以加入本次发行。'],issued:['查看下发结果','发行材料已下发；下发成功与分行已读分别记录。']}[p.status];}
function workbench(){if(role==='branch')return issuance();const todo=state.products.filter(p=>role==='reviewer'?p.status==='review':['returned','difference','check','draft','ready'].includes(p.status));const list=workTab==='todo'?todo:state.products;return title('业务工作台','集中处理待办，跟踪产品申报与发行进度。',link('发起产品申报','ordinary/new','btn primary','plus'),'')+stats([['待我处理',todo.length,role==='reviewer'?'等待复核确认':'包含草稿、差异及待发行','clock'],['差异待处理',state.products.filter(p=>p.status==='difference').length,'需核对后继续办理','search'],['申报办理中',state.products.filter(p=>['review','market','check'].includes(p.status)).length,'复核、金市办理与校验','file'],['已完成下发',state.products.filter(p=>p.status==='issued').length,'材料下发记录','send']])+`<div class="dashboard-grid"><div class="stack"><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>我的业务</h2>${link('进入申报查询 →','query','text-button muted')}</div><div class="tabs"><button class="tab ${workTab==='todo'?'active':''}" data-action="work-tab" data-value="todo">待我处理 <span class="count">${todo.length}</span></button><button class="tab ${workTab==='all'?'active':''}" data-action="work-tab" data-value="all">全部申报 <span class="count">${state.products.length}</span></button></div>${productTable(list,{compact:true})}</section><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>产品办理流程</h2><span class="pill">普通 / 滚存产品共用</span></div>${process('review')}<div class="overview-note">${icon('info')}金市系统回传后进行一致性校验；存在差异时暂停生成发行材料。</div></section></div><div class="stack"><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>快捷申报</h2></div><div class="card-body"><div class="quick-links"><a class="quick-link" href="#ordinary/new">${icon('plus')}<span>普通产品申报</span></a><a class="quick-link" href="#series/new">${icon('repeat')}<span>新增滚存系列</span></a><a class="quick-link" href="#period/new">${icon('file')}<span>系列内产品申报</span></a><a class="quick-link" href="#query">${icon('search')}<span>申报状态查询</span></a></div></div></section><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>发行概况</h2>${icon('send')}</div><div class="card-body info-list"><div class="info-line"><span class="muted">可发行业务产品</span><b>${state.products.filter(eligible).length} 只</b></div><div class="info-line"><span class="muted">待完成发行</span><b>${state.issues.filter(i=>i.status==='draft').length} 项</b></div><div class="info-line"><span class="muted">已下发发行记录</span><b>${state.issues.filter(i=>i.status==='sent').length} 项</b></div>${link('进入发行管理 →','issuance','text-button')}</div></section></div></div>`;}
function process(status){const stages=[['draft','产品申报'],['review','产品复核'],['market','金市办理'],['check','一致性校验'],['ready','发行材料'],['issued','下发分行']];const actual=status==='returned'?'draft':status==='difference'?'check':status;const index=stages.findIndex(([key])=>key===actual);return `<div class="process">${stages.map(([k,n],i)=>`<div class="process-step ${i<index?'done':i===index?'current':''}"><div class="process-dot">${i<index?icon('check'):i+1}</div>${n}</div>`).join('')}</div>`;}
function selectOptions(values,selected,emptyLabel){return `${emptyLabel?`<option value="">${emptyLabel}</option>`:''}${values.map(v=>{const [key,label]=Array.isArray(v)?v:[v,v];return `<option value="${esc(key)}" ${String(key)===String(selected)?'selected':''}>${esc(label)}</option>`;}).join('')}`;}
function applicationList(type){const isQuery=type==='query',rolling=type==='rolling';let products=state.products.filter(p=>isQuery||p.type===type);if(!isQuery)products=products.filter(p=>['draft','returned'].includes(p.status));products=products.filter(p=>(!filters.q||`${p.name} ${p.id} ${p.marketNumber||''}`.toLowerCase().includes(filters.q.toLowerCase()))&&(!filters.status||p.status===filters.status)&&(!filters.type||p.type===filters.type)&&(!filters.series||p.seriesId===filters.series)&&(!filters.from||p.created.slice(0,10)>=filters.from)&&(!filters.to||p.created.slice(0,10)<=filters.to));const h=isQuery?'申报查询':rolling?'系列内产品申报':'普通产品申报';return title(h,isQuery?'统一查询普通产品与滚存产品的申报状态，查看处理意见和办理记录。':rolling?'在已生效的滚存系列内新增产品，每一期独立申报与复核。':'发起普通结构性存款申报，或继续完善未提交的产品。',isQuery?btn('导出查询结果','export-query','','download'):`${btn('批量导入','import','','upload',`data-type="${type}"`)}${link(rolling?'新增期次产品':'新增产品申报',`${rolling?'period':'ordinary'}/new`,'btn primary','plus')}`)+(!isQuery?`<div class="banner">${icon('info')}<span>下方展示草稿及退回待修改的申报。已提交记录请在 ${link('申报查询','query','text-button')} 中查看办理状态。</span></div>`:'')+`<section class="card"><form class="filters" id="queryForm"><div class="filter wide"><label for="q">产品名称 / 申报编号</label><input id="q" name="q" placeholder="输入名称或编号进行查询" value="${esc(filters.q)}"></div>${isQuery?`<div class="filter"><label for="filterType">产品类型</label><select id="filterType" name="type">${selectOptions([['ordinary','普通产品'],['rolling','滚存产品']],filters.type,'全部类型')}</select></div><div class="filter"><label for="filterStatus">申报状态</label><select id="filterStatus" name="status">${selectOptions(Object.entries(STATUS),filters.status,'全部状态')}</select></div><div class="filter"><label for="from">申报开始日期</label><input id="from" name="from" type="date" value="${esc(filters.from)}"></div><div class="filter"><label for="to">申报结束日期</label><input id="to" name="to" type="date" value="${esc(filters.to)}"></div>`:''}${isQuery||rolling?`<div class="filter"><label for="filterSeries">滚存系列</label><select id="filterSeries" name="series">${selectOptions(state.series.map(s=>[s.id,s.id]),filters.series,'全部系列')}</select></div>`:''}<button class="btn primary" type="submit">${icon('search')}查询</button>${btn('重置','reset-filters')}</form><div id="listResult">${productTable(products)}</div></section>`;}
function seriesPage(id){if(id){const s=state.series.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!s)return empty('未找到系列');const ps=state.products.filter(p=>p.seriesId===s.id);return title(esc(s.name),`${esc(s.id)} · ${s.status==='active'?'可继续新增期次':'首期尚未复核通过'}`,link('返回系列列表','series','btn','back')+(s.status==='active'?link('系列内新增产品',`period/new/${s.id}`,'btn primary','plus'):''))+`<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>系列共性要素</h2>${badge(s)}</div><div class="card-body kv-grid">${COMMON_KEYS.map(k=>kv(LABELS[k],s[k])).join('')}${kv('系列说明',s.note)}</div></section><section class="card spacer"><div class="card-head"><h2>系列内产品</h2><span class="muted">共 ${ps.length} 期</span></div>${productTable(ps)}</section>`;}
return title('滚存系列管理','维护滚存系列，汇总各期申报；新建系列与首期产品一并提交复核。',link('新增滚存系列','series/new','btn primary','plus'))+`<div class="series-grid">${state.series.map(s=>{const ps=state.products.filter(p=>p.seriesId===s.id);return `<section class="card series-card"><div class="series-heading"><span class="product-icon rolling">${icon('repeat')}</span><div style="flex:1"><h2>${esc(s.name)}</h2><small>${esc(s.id)}</small></div>${badge(s)}</div><div class="series-meta"><div><span>产品系列</span><b>${esc(s.family)}</b></div><div><span>产品结构</span><b>${esc(s.structure)}</b></div><div><span>币种</span><b>${esc(s.currency)}</b></div><div><span>挂钩标的</span><b>${esc(s.underlying)}</b></div><div><span>期次总数</span><b>${ps.length} 期</b></div><div><span>最新期次</span><b>第 ${Math.max(0,...ps.map(p=>Number(p.period)))} 期</b></div></div><div class="series-bottom"><span>创建于 ${esc(s.created.slice(0,10))}</span><div class="flex">${link('查看系列',`series/${s.id}`,'text-button')}${s.status==='active'?link('新增期次',`period/new/${s.id}`,'btn small','plus'):''}</div></div></section>`;}).join('')}</div>`;}
function field(key,label,value,{type='text',options=null,required=false,hint='',readonly=false,cls='',attrs=''}={}){return `<div class="field ${cls}"><label for="f-${key}">${required?'<span class="required">*</span>':''}${label}</label>${options?`<select id="f-${key}" name="${key}" ${readonly?'disabled':''} ${attrs}>${selectOptions(options,value)}</select>`:`<input id="f-${key}" name="${key}" type="${type}" value="${esc(value)}" ${readonly?'readonly':''} ${attrs}>`}${hint?`<div class="hint">${hint}</div>`:''}</div>`;}
function formPage(type,id='',seriesId='',isNewSeries=false){let p=id?clone(state.products.find(x=>x.id===id)):blankProduct(type);if(!p)return empty('未找到产品');if(id&&!['draft','returned'].includes(p.status))return empty('该申报当前不可修改','请在申报详情中继续办理。');if(role!=='manager')return empty('请切换至产品经理','新增及修改申报由产品经理办理。');
if(seriesId){const s=state.series.find(s=>s.id===seriesId);if(s){for(const k of COMMON_KEYS)p[k]=s[k];p.seriesId=s.id;p.period=Math.max(0,...state.products.filter(x=>x.seriesId===s.id).map(x=>Number(x.period)))+1;}}
if(isNewSeries){p.type='rolling';p.period=1;p.firstPeriod=true;}
const rolling=p.type==='rolling';const series=state.series.find(s=>s.id===p.seriesId);const commonRead=rolling&&!isNewSeries;return title(isNewSeries?'新增滚存系列':id?'修改产品申报':rolling?'系列内新增产品':'普通产品申报',isNewSeries?'系列信息与首期产品一并填写，一并提交复核。':rolling?'选择所属系列，带入共性要素，再填写本期产品信息。':'填写产品要素，保存草稿或直接提交复核。',btn('返回','back','','back'))+`<div id="formErrors" class="form-errors" role="alert"></div><form id="productForm" class="card" data-id="${esc(id)}" data-type="${p.type}" data-newseries="${isNewSeries}">${isNewSeries?`<section class="form-section"><h2><span class="section-index">01</span>滚存系列信息</h2><div class="form-grid">${field('newSeriesId','滚存系列号','',{required:true,hint:'系列的唯一标识，例如 2027年C'})}${field('newSeriesName','滚存系列名称','',{required:true,cls:'span2'})}${field('seriesNote','系列说明','',{cls:'span3'})}</div></section>`:rolling?`<section class="form-section"><h2><span class="section-index">01</span>产品归属</h2><div class="form-grid">${field('seriesId','所属滚存系列',p.seriesId,{options:[['','请选择已生效系列'],...state.series.filter(s=>s.status==='active'||s.id===p.seriesId).map(s=>[s.id,`${s.id} · ${s.name}`])],required:true,cls:'span2',readonly:!!id})}${field('period','滚存期次',p.period,{type:'number',required:true,attrs:'min="1" step="1"'})}</div></section>`:''}<section class="form-section"><h2><span class="section-index">${rolling?'02':'01'}</span>${isNewSeries?'首期产品与共性要素':'产品基本信息'}</h2><div class="form-grid">${field('name','产品名称',p.name,{required:true,cls:'span2',attrs:'maxlength="80"'})}${field('family','产品系列',p.family,{options:['智信','慧信'],required:true,readonly:commonRead})}${field('structure','产品结构',p.structure,{options:['三元','二元','区间累计','价差'],required:true,readonly:commonRead})}${field('underlying','挂钩标的',p.underlying,{required:true,readonly:commonRead})}${field('currency','币种',p.currency,{options:['人民币','美元'],required:true,readonly:commonRead})}</div></section><section class="form-section"><h2><span class="section-index">${rolling?'03':'02'}</span>募集与存续安排</h2><div class="form-grid">${['start','end','value','maturity'].map(k=>field(k,LABELS[k],p[k],{type:'date',required:true})).join('')}${field('tenor','产品期限（天）',p.tenor,{type:'number',required:true,hint:'根据起息日、到期日自动计算',readonly:true})}${rolling?['observeStart','observeEnd'].map(k=>field(k,LABELS[k],p[k],{type:'date',required:true})).join(''):''}</div></section><section class="form-section"><h2><span class="section-index">${rolling?'04':'03'}</span>收益与成本</h2><div class="form-grid">${['low','mid','high'].map(k=>field(k,LABELS[k],p[k],{type:'number',attrs:'min="0" step="0.01"',hint:'按百分数填写，不适用档位留空'})).join('')}${field('cost','投资成本（%）',p.cost,{type:'number',attrs:'min="0" step="0.01"',hint:'内部字段，分行材料不展示'})}</div></section><section class="form-section"><h2><span class="section-index">${rolling?'05':'04'}</span>额度与起存金额</h2><div class="form-grid">${field('quota','产品额度（万元）',p.quota,{type:'number',required:true,attrs:'min="0" step="0.01"'})}${field('forecast','预估销售金额（万元）',p.forecast,{type:'number',attrs:'min="0" step="0.01"'})}<div></div>${field('minimum','起存金额',p.minimum,{type:'number',required:true,attrs:'min="0" step="0.01"'})}${field('minimumUnit','起存金额单位',p.minimumUnit,{options:['元','万元'],required:true,hint:'按产品币种解释；美元 + 元表示美元'})}${field('notes','申报说明',p.notes,{cls:'span3'})}</div></section><footer class="form-footer"><small>${isNewSeries?'首期固定为第 1 期，复核通过后可新增后续期次。':'草稿可继续修改；提交后由复核岗办理。'}</small><div class="flex">${btn('保存草稿','save-product','','',`data-draft="true"`)}${btn('提交复核','save-product','primary','send','data-draft="false"')}</div></footer></form>`;}
function kv(label,value){return `<div class="kv-item"><span>${esc(label)}</span><b>${present(value)?esc(value):'—'}</b></div>`;}
function productDetail(id){const p=state.products.find(p=>p.id===id);if(!p)return empty('未找到申报');const task=taskText(p);let actions='';if(role==='manager'){if(['draft','returned'].includes(p.status))actions=link('修改申报',`${p.type==='rolling'?'period':'ordinary'}/edit/${p.id}`,'btn primary','edit');if(p.status==='market')actions=btn('金市回传','receive','primary','download',`data-id="${p.id}"`);if(p.status==='check')actions=btn('开始一致性校验','transition','primary','shield',`data-id="${p.id}" data-value="check"`);if(p.status==='difference')actions=btn('反馈金市修正','decision','','',`data-id="${p.id}" data-value="correct"`)+btn('调整申报并重审','decision','primary','edit',`data-id="${p.id}" data-value="revise"`);if(p.status==='ready')actions=btn('加入本次发行','new-issue','primary','send',`data-id="${p.id}"`);if(p.status==='issued')actions=link('查看发行记录','issuance','btn','send');}if(role==='reviewer'&&p.status==='review')actions=btn('退回修改','decision','danger','',`data-id="${p.id}" data-value="return"`)+btn('复核通过','decision','primary','check',`data-id="${p.id}" data-value="approve"`);return title(esc(p.name),`申报编号 ${esc(p.id)}　·　${p.type==='rolling'?`滚存产品 / ${esc(p.seriesId)} / 第 ${esc(p.period)} 期`:'普通结构性存款'}`,link('返回申报查询','query','btn','back'))+`<section class="card"><div class="detail-summary"><div><span>当前状态</span>${badge(p)}</div><div><span>申报版本</span><b>V${p.version||0}</b></div><div><span>金市产品编号</span><b>${esc(p.marketNumber||'待金市回传')}</b></div><div><span>最近更新</span><b>${esc(p.updated)}</b></div></div>${process(p.status)}<div class="task-box"><div><h3>${task[0]}</h3><p>${esc(task[1])}</p></div><div class="task-actions">${actions||`<span class="muted">${p.status==='review'?'切换至产品复核岗后办理':'当前角色可查看办理进度'}</span>`}</div></div></section><section class="card spacer"><div class="tabs">${[['elements','产品要素'],['comparison','一致性校验'],['materials','相关材料'],['history','办理记录']].map(([v,n])=>`<button class="tab ${detailTab===v?'active':''}" data-action="detail-tab" data-value="${v}">${n}${v==='history'?` <span class="count">${p.history.length}</span>`:''}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="tab-content">${detailTab==='elements'?`<div class="card-body kv-grid">${(p.type==='rolling'?ROLLING_COLUMNS:NORMAL_COLUMNS).map(([k,n])=>kv(n,p[k])).join('')}${kv('申报说明',p.notes)}</div>`:detailTab==='history'?`<div class="card-body">${history(p.history)}</div>`:detailTab==='comparison'?comparison(p):`<div class="card-body">${p.prospectus?`<div class="file-row">${icon('file')}<div>产品说明书<small>金市回传 · 不含内部成本 · ${esc(p.marketNumber)}</small></div>${btn('查看','prospectus','','',`data-id="${p.id}"`)}${btn('下载','download-prospectus','','download',`data-id="${p.id}"`)}</div>`:empty('暂无回传材料','金市回传后展示最终要素及说明书。')}</div>`}</div></section>`;}
function comparison(p){const rows=compare(p);if(!rows.length)return empty('尚未具备校验资料','金市回传后，将申报、最终要素和说明书逐项比对。');return `<div class="card-body" style="padding-bottom:0"><div class="banner ${rows.some(r=>!r.ok)?'warn':'success'}">${icon('shield')}<span>${rows.some(r=>!r.ok)?`发现 ${rows.filter(r=>!r.ok).length} 项差异；材料生成已阻断。`:`${rows.length} 项要素一致。${p.status==='check'?'请执行校验以确认结果。':'校验结果已记录。'}`}</span></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="compare-table"><thead><tr><th>校验字段</th><th>已复核申报 V${p.version}</th><th>金市最终要素</th><th>说明书</th><th>比对结果</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(r=>`<tr class="${r.ok?'':'diff-row'}"><td>${r.label}</td><td>${esc(r.a)||'—'}</td><td>${esc(r.b)||'—'}</td><td>${esc(r.c)||'—'}${p.prospectusSource?`<div class="subline">${p.prospectusSource.manualFields.includes(r.key)?'人工补充':p.prospectusSource.evidence[r.key]?.page?'原文第 '+p.prospectusSource.evidence[r.key].page+' 页':'原文识别'}</div>`:''}</td><td class="${r.ok?'compare-ok':'compare-bad'}">${r.ok?'一致':'存在差异'}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`;}
function history(items){return `<div class="history">${items.map(h=>`<div class="history-item"><h4>${esc(h.action)} <small>　${esc(h.actor||'产品经理')} · ${esc(h.time)}</small></h4><p>${esc(h.note)}</p></div>`).join('')}</div>`;}
function visibleIssues(){return role==='branch'?state.issues.filter(i=>i.status==='sent'&&i.recipients.some(r=>r.name===branch&&r.status==='sent')):state.issues;}
function issuance(){
 const issues=visibleIssues();
 const preparation=role==='manager'?`<section class="issuance-preparation"><div>${icon('file')}<div><strong>发行前准备：接收金市回传</strong><p>读取产品说明书，核对申报及金市最终要素；校验通过后，用于生成发行通知和海报。</p></div></div>${btn('接收金市回传','intake-prospectus','','upload')}</section>`:'';
 return title(role==='branch'?'发行材料接收':'发行管理',role==='branch'?'查看本分行收到的发行通知、说明书及海报。':'按发行批次制作通知与海报，核对配套说明书后下发至分行。',role==='manager'?btn('新建发行','new-issue','primary','plus'):'')
 +(role==='branch'?`<div class="branch-info flex">当前分行：<select id="branchSelect" style="width:170px">${selectOptions(BRANCHES,branch)}</select><span>仅展示下发成功的本分行材料</span></div>`:'')
 +`<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>${role==='branch'?'已接收材料':'发行记录'}</h2><span class="muted">共 ${issues.length} 项</span></div>${issues.length?`<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>发行名称 / 编号</th><th>产品数量</th><th>办理状态</th><th>${role==='branch'?'阅读状态':'下发情况'}</th><th>时间</th><th style="text-align:right">发行材料 / 操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>${issues.map(i=>`<tr><td><a class="product-name" href="#issue/${i.id}">${esc(i.title)}</a><div class="subline">${i.id}</div></td><td>${i.productIds.length} 只</td><td><span class="badge ${i.status==='sent'?'issued':'draft'}">${i.status==='sent'?'已下发':'材料准备中'}</span></td><td>${role==='branch'?(i.recipients.find(r=>r.name===branch)?.read?'已读':'未读'):i.status==='sent'?`${i.recipients.filter(r=>r.status==='sent').length} / ${i.recipients.length} 家成功`:i.recipients.length?`已选 ${i.recipients.length} 家`:'待选择分行'}</td><td class="muted">${i.sentAt||i.created}</td><td><div class="issue-row-actions">${link('发行通知',`issue/${i.id}/notice`,'text-button')}${link('发行海报',`issue/${i.id}/poster`,'text-button')}${link(role==='branch'?'查看材料':i.status==='sent'?'查看结果':'继续办理',`issue/${i.id}`,'btn small')}</div></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:empty('暂无发行记录','点击“新建发行”，选择已通过一致性校验的产品。')}</section>`+preparation;
}
function issuePage(id){const i=visibleIssues().find(i=>i.id===id);if(!i)return empty('暂无可查看的发行记录');if(role==='branch'){const receipt=i.recipients.find(r=>r.name===branch);if(!receipt.read){receipt.read=true;receipt.readAt=now();save();}}
const ps=i.productIds.map(id=>state.products.find(p=>p.id===id));const draft=i.status==='draft',editable=draft&&role==='manager';return title(esc(i.title),`${esc(i.id)}　·　${draft?'准备发行材料':`已下发于 ${esc(i.sentAt)}`}`,link('返回发行管理','issuance','btn','back'))+`<div class="issue-grid"><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>发行材料</h2><p class="subtitle">根据最终产品要素生成通知和海报，配套产品说明书。</p></div>${editable&&i.material?btn(i.notice?'重新生成通知':'使用通知模板','generate-material','','file',`data-id="${id}"`):''}</div><div class="material-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="发行材料">${[['notice','发行通知','按模板生成、编辑和下载'],['poster','发行海报','单产品与多产品合集'],['prospectus','产品说明书','查看原件与取数要素']].map(([value,label,hint])=>`<button type="button" class="material-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="materialView" id="material-${value}" data-action="material-tab" data-value="${value}"><strong>${label}</strong><small>${hint}</small></button>`).join('')}</div><div id="materialView" role="tabpanel" class="material-bg"></div><div class="card-body material-confirmation">${editable?`<div class="flex between">${btn('保存通知修改','save-material','','check',`data-id="${id}"`)}<label class="checkbox-line"><input id="materialConfirmed" type="checkbox" ${i.confirmed?'checked':''} ${!i.material?'disabled':''}>已核对通知、说明书及海报</label>${!i.material?'<span class="muted">生成通知并核对全部材料后，可确认下发。</span>':''}</div>`:!i.notice&&i.material?`${btn('下载发行通知','download-notice','','download',`data-id="${id}"`)}`:''}</div></section><div class="stack"><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>本次发行产品</h2><span class="count">${ps.length}</span></div><div class="card-body">${ps.map(p=>`<div class="issue-product"><strong>${esc(p.name)}</strong><small>${esc(p.marketNumber)} · ${p.tenor} 天</small></div>`).join('')}</div></section>${editable?`<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>下发范围</h2></div><div class="card-body"><div class="recipient-grid">${BRANCHES.map(b=>`<label class="checkbox-line"><input type="checkbox" name="recipient" value="${b}" ${i.recipients.some(r=>r.name===b)?'checked':''}>${b}</label>`).join('')}</div><div style="height:20px"></div>${btn('确认下发','send-issue','primary','send',`data-id="${id}" style="width:100%" ${!i.confirmed||!i.material?'disabled':''}`)}</div></section>`:role!=='branch'?`<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>分行接收情况</h2></div><div class="card-body">${i.recipients.map(r=>`<div class="issue-status"><span>${r.name}</span><span style="color:${r.status==='failed'?'#b66c4e':'#6b9b8d'}">${r.status==='failed'?'下发失败':r.read?'已下发 · 已读':'已下发 · 未读'}</span></div>`).join('')}${role==='manager'&&i.recipients.some(r=>r.status==='failed')?`<div style="margin-top:15px">${btn('重试失败分行','retry-issue','','repeat',`data-id="${id}"`)}</div>`:''}</div></section>`:`<section class="card"><div class="card-body"><div class="banner success" style="margin:0">${icon('check')}${esc(branch)}已接收并标记已读</div></div></section>`}</div></div>${role!=='branch'?`<section class="card spacer"><div class="card-head"><h2>发行办理记录</h2></div><div class="card-body">${history(i.history)}</div></section>`:''}`;}
function notice(i,editable){if(!i.material)return `<div class="notice-start">${icon('file')}<h3>生成本次发行通知</h3><p>已选 ${i.productIds.length} 只产品。按通知模板带入产品代码、名称、募集日期及附件清单，再补充成文日期等信息。</p>${editable?btn('生成发行通知','generate-material','primary','file',`data-id="${i.id}"`):'<span class="muted">待产品经理生成发行通知</span>'}<small>海报可直接在“发行海报”中制作，无需先生成通知。</small></div>`;if(i.notice)return '<div id="noticeWorkspace"></div>';return `${editable?'<div class="notice-legacy-hint">已保留原通知内容。点击上方“使用通知模板”，可按说明书要素生成产品表和附件清单。</div>':''}<div class="paper">${editable?`<textarea id="materialEditor" class="paper-editor" aria-label="发行通知内容">${esc(i.material)}</textarea>`:esc(i.material)}</div>`;}
function render(){const [r,sub,id]=route();if(role==='branch'&&!['workbench','issuance','issue'].includes(r)){navigate('issuance');return;}let content;if(r==='workbench')content=workbench();else if(r==='ordinary'||r==='period'){content=sub==='new'||sub==='edit'?formPage(r==='period'?'rolling':'ordinary',sub==='edit'?id:'',sub==='new'?id:''):applicationList(r==='period'?'rolling':'ordinary');}else if(r==='query')content=applicationList('query');else if(r==='series')content=sub==='new'?formPage('rolling','','',true):seriesPage(sub);else if(r==='product')content=productDetail(sub);else if(r==='issuance')content=issuance();else if(r==='issue')content=issuePage(sub);else content=empty('页面不存在',link('返回工作台','workbench','text-button'));$('#app').innerHTML=shell(content);document.title=`${$('.page h1')?.textContent||'工作台'} · 存款经营平台`;if(r==='issue'&&$('#materialView'))materialTab(['notice','poster','prospectus'].includes(id)?id:'notice');}
function showModal(title,body,footer='',wide=false,sub=''){const m=$('#modal');m.className=wide?'wide':'';m.innerHTML=`<div class="modal-head"><div><h2 id="modalTitle">${title}</h2>${sub?`<p>${sub}</p>`:''}</div><button class="toolbar-icon" data-action="close-modal" aria-label="关闭">${icon('close')}</button></div><div class="modal-body">${body}</div>${footer?`<div class="modal-footer">${footer}</div>`:''}`;if(!m.open)m.showModal();}
function closeModal(){$('#modal').close();importData=null;}
function errorBox(errors){$('#formErrors').innerHTML=`<b>请检查以下内容</b><ul>${errors.map(e=>`<li>${esc(e.label)}：${esc(e.message)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`;$$('.error-field').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('error-field'));errors.forEach(e=>document.getElementById('f-'+e.field)?.classList.add('error-field'));$('#formErrors').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});}
function collectProduct(){const form=$('#productForm');const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form));data.type=form.dataset.type;const old=state.products.find(p=>p.id===form.dataset.id);if(data.type==='rolling'&&form.dataset.newseries!=='true'){const s=state.series.find(s=>s.id===(data.seriesId||old?.seriesId));if(s){data.seriesId=s.id;for(const k of COMMON_KEYS)data[k]=s[k];}if(old?.firstPeriod)data.firstPeriod=true;}if(form.dataset.newseries==='true'){data.seriesId=data.newSeriesId?.trim();data.period=1;data.firstPeriod=true;}for(const k in data)if(typeof data[k]==='string')data[k]=data[k].trim();return data;}
function submitProduct(draft){const form=$('#productForm'),data=collectProduct(),id=form.dataset.id,isNew=form.dataset.newseries==='true';let errors=validate(data,state,{draft,newSeries:isNew,ignoreId:id});if(isNew){if(!/^[A-Za-z0-9\u4e00-\u9fff_-]+$/.test(data.newSeriesId||''))errors.push({field:'newSeriesId',label:'滚存系列号',message:'请填写中文、字母、数字、横线或下划线'});if(state.series.some(s=>s.id===data.newSeriesId))errors.push({field:'newSeriesId',label:'滚存系列号',message:'该系列号已存在'});if(!data.newSeriesName)errors.push({field:'newSeriesName',label:'滚存系列名称',message:'不能为空'});}
if(errors.length){errorBox(errors);return;}if(isNew)state.series.unshift({id:data.seriesId,name:data.newSeriesName,...Object.fromEntries(COMMON_KEYS.map(k=>[k,data[k]])),note:data.seriesNote,created:now(),status:'pending'});let p;if(id){p=state.products.find(p=>p.id===id);Object.assign(p,data);p.updated=now();if(draft)log(p,'保存修改','已保存申报草稿');else transition(state,p.id,'submit',{role});}else p=createProduct(state,data,{draft,newSeries:isNew}).product;save();formDirty=false;detailTab='elements';navigate('product/'+p.id);toast(draft?'草稿已保存':'已提交，等待产品复核岗办理');}
function downloadBlob(name,content,type='text/plain;charset=utf-8'){const a=document.createElement('a');const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([content],{type}));a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);}
function workbookDownload(rows,name,sheet='数据'){const wb=XLSX.utils.book_new();const ws=XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(rows);ws['!cols']=rows[0].map(()=>({wch:22}));XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb,ws,sheet);XLSX.writeFile(wb,name);}
function template(type,example=false){const columns=type==='rolling'?ROLLING_COLUMNS:NORMAL_COLUMNS;const wb=XLSX.utils.book_new();const sample={...blankProduct(type),name:'智信稳享新增产品',seriesId:'2026年A',period:4,family:'智信',structure:'三元',currency:'人民币',underlying:'欧元兑美元',start:'2026-11-01',end:'2026-11-08',value:'2026-11-09',maturity:'2026-11-22',tenor:13,observeStart:'2026-11-09',observeEnd:'2026-11-20',low:1.05,mid:1.65,high:1.85,cost:1.7,quota:6000,forecast:5000,minimum:10000,minimumUnit:'元'};const rows=[columns.map(c=>c[1]),...(example?[columns.map(c=>sample[c[0]]??'')]:[])];const ws=XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(rows);ws['!cols']=columns.map(()=>({wch:23}));XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb,ws,'申报数据');XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb,XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet([['填写说明'],['请在“申报数据”工作表填写；表头不得修改。单次最多 500 行。'],['日期填 YYYY-MM-DD 或 Excel 日期；收益率与成本填百分数，1.50 表示 1.50%。'],['额度、预估销售金额以所选币种的万元计。起存金额单位单独选择元/万元。'],['币种可选人民币、美元；产品系列、结构按相应字段填写。'],['低、中、高收益率至少填一项，不适用留空。'],['滚存产品需匹配已生效系列，不会自动新增系列。共性字段须与系列一致。'],['不要填写公式；在 Excel 修改完成后重新上传。实际募集金额不在发行前申报中填写。'],['请核对填写内容，上传后完成校验再提交。']]),'填写说明');if(!example){const sw=XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet([columns.map(c=>c[1]),columns.map(c=>sample[c[0]]??'')]);sw['!cols']=ws['!cols'];XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb,sw,'示例_不导入');}XLSX.writeFile(wb,`${type==='rolling'?'滚存期次':'普通产品'}${example?'_填写示例':'_申报模板'}.xlsx`);}
function importModal(type){importData={type,rows:[],file:'',committed:false};showModal('批量导入'+(type==='rolling'?'滚存期次':'普通产品'),`<div class="step-strip"><span class="on"><b>1</b>下载模板并填写</span><span><b>2</b>上传与校验</span><span><b>3</b>确认并提交</span></div><div class="banner">${icon('info')}导入后展示只读预览。若有问题，请在 Excel 中修正后重新上传。</div><div class="flex between" style="margin-bottom:18px"><span class="muted">请使用专用模板，表头及金额单位保持一致。</span><div class="flex">${btn('下载填写示例','example','','',`data-type="${type}"`)}${btn('下载模板','template','','download',`data-type="${type}"`)}</div></div><label class="upload-zone">${icon('upload')}<strong>点击选择 Excel 文件，或将文件拖入此处</strong><small>.xlsx 格式 · 不超过 5 MB · 最多 500 条产品</small><input id="importFile" type="file" accept=".xlsx"></label><div id="importResult"></div>`,btn('取消','close-modal'),true);}
async function parseFile(file){if(!importData)return;if(!/\.xlsx$/i.test(file.name)||file.size>5*1024*1024){toast('请选择不超过 5 MB 的 .xlsx 文件',true);return;}const active=importData;active.rows=[];active.file=file.name;$('#importResult').innerHTML='<div class="banner spacer">正在解析并检查文件…</div>';try{const wb=XLSX.read(await file.arrayBuffer(),{type:'array',cellDates:true});if(importData!==active)return;const ws=wb.Sheets['申报数据'];if(!ws)throw Error('未找到“申报数据”工作表，请下载并使用本页模板。');const range=XLSX.utils.decode_range(ws['!ref']||'A1');if(range.e.r>500)throw Error('单次最多导入 500 行，请拆分后上传。');const columns=active.type==='rolling'?ROLLING_COLUMNS:NORMAL_COLUMNS;const raw=XLSX.utils.sheet_to_json(ws,{header:1,defval:'',raw:true,blankrows:true});if(!raw[0]||columns.some((c,i)=>String(raw[0][i]).trim()!==c[1])||raw[0].length>columns.length)throw Error('表头与模板不一致，请重新下载模板，保留全部列名及顺序。');const data=raw.slice(1).map((r,index)=>({r,index})).filter(({r})=>r.some(v=>String(v).trim()!==''));if(!data.length)throw Error('“申报数据”工作表没有产品记录。');const rows=data.map(({r})=>Object.fromEntries(columns.map(([k],j)=>{let v=r[j]??'';if(v instanceof Date)v=`${v.getFullYear()}-${String(v.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(v.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`;return [k,String(v).trim()];})));active.rows=validateBatch(rows,state,active.type);active.rows.forEach((r,i)=>{r.row=data[i].index+2;for(let j=0;j<columns.length;j++){const cell=ws[XLSX.utils.encode_cell({r:r.row-1,c:j})];if(cell?.f)r.errors.push({field:columns[j][0],label:columns[j][1],message:'请将公式转为确定的数值后上传'});}});renderImport();}catch(e){if(importData===active){$('#importResult').innerHTML=`<div class="form-errors spacer">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;$('#modal .modal-footer').innerHTML=btn('关闭','close-modal');}}}
function renderImport(){const d=importData;const bad=d.rows.filter(r=>r.errors.length).length;$('#importResult').innerHTML=`<div class="import-stats"><span>${icon('file')} ${esc(d.file)}</span><span>共 <b>${d.rows.length}</b> 条</span><span>通过 <b>${d.rows.length-bad}</b></span><span class="import-stat-error">问题 <b>${bad}</b></span>${bad?btn('下载错误清单','import-errors','small','download'):''}</div><div class="import-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Excel 行号</th><th>产品名称</th><th>期限</th><th>校验结果</th><th>完整要素（只读）</th></tr></thead><tbody>${d.rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${r.row}</td><td>${esc(r.product.name)||'—'}</td><td>${esc(r.product.tenor)} 天</td><td>${r.errors.length?`<ul class="error-list">${r.errors.map(e=>`<li>${esc(e.label)}：${esc(e.message)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`:'<span class="badge ready">通过</span>'}</td><td><details class="row-details"><summary>展开要素</summary><dl>${(d.type==='rolling'?ROLLING_COLUMNS:NORMAL_COLUMNS).map(([k,n])=>`<dt>${n}</dt><dd>${esc(r.product[k])||'—'}</dd>`).join('')}</dl></details></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><p class="subtitle" style="margin-top:14px">${bad?'整批校验通过后才能保存或提交。请在 Excel 中修改，再上传替换本次预览。':'预览尚未生成申报记录。确认后逐只创建产品，并保留各自办理状态。'}</p>`;$('#modal .modal-footer').innerHTML=btn('取消','close-modal')+btn('保存为草稿','commit-import','','','data-draft="true" '+(bad?'disabled':''))+btn(`提交 ${d.rows.length} 条申报`,'commit-import','primary','send','data-draft="false" '+(bad?'disabled':''));}
function newIssueModal(preselect){if(role!=='manager'){toast('请切换至产品经理',true);return;}const candidates=state.products.filter(p=>eligible(p)&&!state.issues.some(i=>i.status==='draft'&&i.productIds.includes(p.id)));showModal('新建发行',`${field('issueTitle','发行名称','结构性存款产品发行',{required:true})}<p class="subtitle" style="margin:20px 0 10px">选择已通过一致性校验、且尚未加入待完成发行的产品。</p>${candidates.length?`<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>选择</th><th>产品名称</th><th>产品期限</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>${candidates.map(p=>`<tr><td><input class="table-check" type="checkbox" name="issueProduct" value="${p.id}" ${p.id===preselect?'checked':''} aria-label="选择 ${esc(p.name)}"></td><td>${esc(p.name)}</td><td>${p.tenor} 天</td><td>${badge(p)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:empty('暂无可选产品','请先完成产品一致性校验，或继续办理已创建的发行。')}`,btn('取消','close-modal')+btn('创建发行','create-issue','primary','',''+(!candidates.length?'disabled':'')),true);}
function generatedNotice(i){saveNotice(state,i,undefined,{record:true});return i.material;}
async function downloadNotice(i){if(i.notice){if(i.status!=='sent')assertNoticeReady(state,i);const doc=noticeDocument(i),blob=await noticeDocx(doc);downloadBlob(doc.title+'.docx',blob,'application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document');}else downloadBlob(i.title+'_通知.html',standaloneDoc(i.title,`<pre>${esc(i.material)}</pre>`),'text/html;charset=utf-8');}
function prospectusHTML(p){const v=p.prospectus||p;return `${p.prospectusSource?`<div class="source-original-reference"><strong>${esc(p.prospectusSource.name)}</strong><small>原文识别与人工补充分开保存 · ${p.prospectusSource.pages?p.prospectusSource.pages+' 页':'Word正文'}</small>${btn('查看原件','original-prospectus','','file',`data-id="${p.id}"`)}</div>`:''}<h2 style="font-size:19px">${esc(v.name)}</h2><p>说明书要素（金市回传）</p><p class="subtitle">以下为回传的结构化要素；产品说明书原文及风险揭示书作为独立附件。</p><div class="kv-grid">${COMPARE_FIELDS.filter(([k])=>p.type==='rolling'||!['observeStart','observeEnd'].includes(k)).map(([k,n])=>kv(n,v[k])).join('')}</div>`;}
function standaloneDoc(title,body){return `<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>${esc(title)}</title><style>body{font-family:'PingFang SC',sans-serif;max-width:900px;margin:50px auto;padding:20px;line-height:1.9;color:#253c48}.kv-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.kv-item span{display:block;color:#87969f;font-size:12px}.kv-item b{font-weight:400}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:inherit}h1{font-size:23px}</style><h1>${esc(title)}</h1>${body}</html>`;}
function materialTab(value){
 const i=state.issues.find(i=>i.id===route()[1]);if(!i)return;
 const editor=$('#materialEditor');if(editor&&editor.value!==i.material){i.material=editor.value;i.confirmed=false;save();}
 $$('[data-action="material-tab"]').forEach(b=>{const active=b.dataset.value===value;b.classList.toggle('active',active);b.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(active));});
 window.history.replaceState(null,'',`#issue/${i.id}/${value}`);
 const editable=i.status==='draft'&&role==='manager',root=$('#materialView');
 root.setAttribute('aria-labelledby','material-'+value);root.onclick=null;root.oninput=null;root.onchange=null;
 const changed=()=>{save();const confirmed=$('#materialConfirmed');if(confirmed)confirmed.checked=false;const send=$('[data-action="send-issue"]');if(send)send.disabled=true;};
 if(value==='notice'){root.innerHTML=notice(i,editable);if(i.notice)mountNotice($('#noticeWorkspace'),{state,issue:i,editable,onChange:changed,onError:message=>toast(message,true),onDownload:()=>downloadNotice(i)});}
 if(value==='prospectus')root.innerHTML=`<div class="card-body"><div class="material-source-note"><strong>通知与海报的取数依据</strong><p>本次产品已完成一致性校验。发行通知使用说明书中的产品代码、名称和募集日期；海报使用已核对的最终要素。原始说明书作为配套材料单独保留。</p></div>${i.productIds.map(id=>{const p=state.products.find(p=>p.id===id);return `<div class="file-row">${icon('file')}<div>${esc(p.name)}<small>${p.prospectusSource?esc(p.prospectusSource.name||p.prospectusSource.fileName||'已接收说明书原件'):'已保存回传要素，尚未关联原件'} · ${esc(p.marketNumber)}</small></div>${p.prospectusSource?btn('查看原件','original-prospectus','small','',`data-id="${id}"`):''}${btn('查看要素','prospectus','small','',`data-id="${id}"`)}${btn('导出要素','download-prospectus','small','download',`data-id="${id}"`)}</div>`;}).join('')}</div>`;
 if(value==='poster')mountPoster(root,{state,issue:i,editable,onChange:changed,onError:message=>toast(message,true)});
 const saveButton=$('[data-action="save-material"]');if(saveButton)saveButton.hidden=value!=='notice'||!!i.notice||!i.material;
 const downloadButton=$('[data-action="download-notice"]');if(downloadButton)downloadButton.hidden=value!=='notice';
}

function help(){showModal('使用帮助',`<ol class="help-list"><li>通过“普通产品申报”新增产品，或下载模板后批量导入。</li><li>通过“滚存系列管理”新增系列与首期产品；首期复核通过后，可继续新增后续期次。</li><li>复核岗在工作台处理待复核申报；退回时填写处理意见。</li><li>通过“金市回传”接收产品说明书，识别要素后与已复核申报、金市最终要素核对，再完成一致性校验。</li><li>在“发行管理”中新建发行，分别制作发行通知和发行海报，核对产品说明书后下发至分行。</li><li>通过“申报查询”跟踪申报状态，查看产品要素和办理记录。</li></ol>`,btn('关闭','close-modal','primary'));}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-action]');if(!b||b.disabled)return;const a=b.dataset.action,id=b.dataset.id,value=b.dataset.value;try{
 if(a==='toggle-nav'){const el=$('#businessNav');el.hidden=!el.hidden;b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',!el.hidden);}else if(a==='toggle-sub'){const el=b.nextElementSibling;el.hidden=!el.hidden;b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',!el.hidden);}else if(a==='mobile-menu')$('.sidebar').classList.toggle('open');
 else if(a==='help')help();else if(a==='close-modal')closeModal();else if(a==='back')navigate(route()[0]==='period'?'period':route()[0]==='series'?'series':'ordinary');
 else if(a==='reset-filters'){filters={q:'',type:'',status:'',series:'',from:'',to:''};pageNum=1;render();}else if(a==='page'||a==='prev-page'||a==='next-page'){pageNum=a==='page'?Number(b.dataset.page):pageNum+(a==='prev-page'?-1:1);render();}
 else if(a==='work-tab'){workTab=value;pageNum=1;render();}else if(a==='detail-tab'){detailTab=value;render();}
 else if(a==='save-product')submitProduct(b.dataset.draft==='true');
 else if(a==='decision'){const titles={approve:'确认复核通过',return:'退回修改',correct:'反馈金市修正',revise:'调整申报并重新复核'};showModal(titles[value],`<p class="subtitle" style="margin-bottom:18px">${value==='approve'?'通过后进入金市办理环节。':'请填写具体处理意见，内容将保留在办理记录中。'}</p><label for="decisionNote" class="muted">${value==='approve'?'复核意见（选填）':'处理意见（必填）'}</label><textarea id="decisionNote" style="margin-top:10px" placeholder="填写处理意见"></textarea>`,btn('取消','close-modal')+btn('确认','confirm-decision','primary','',`data-id="${id}" data-value="${value}"`));}
 else if(a==='confirm-decision'){transition(state,id,value,{role,note:$('#decisionNote').value});save();closeModal();detailTab='history';render();toast('办理结果已保存');}
 else if(a==='transition'){transition(state,id,value,{role});save();detailTab='comparison';render();toast('校验完成，结果已记录');}
 else if(a==='receive'||a==='intake-prospectus'){openProspectusIntake({state,productId:a==='receive'?id:'',role,showModal,closeModal,onSaved:productId=>{save();detailTab='comparison';navigate('product/'+productId);toast('已保存说明书原件及回传要素，请执行一致性校验');},onError:message=>toast(message,true)});}
 else if(a==='import'){if(role!=='manager')throw Error('请切换至产品经理');importModal(b.dataset.type);}else if(a==='template'||a==='example')template(b.dataset.type,a==='example');
 else if(a==='import-errors')workbookDownload([['工作表','Excel行号','产品名称','问题字段','原因'],...importData.rows.flatMap(r=>r.errors.map(e=>['申报数据',r.row,r.product.name,e.label,e.message]))],'导入错误清单.xlsx');
 else if(a==='commit-import'){if(!importData||importData.committed)return;const ps=commitBatch(state,importData.rows,b.dataset.draft==='true');importData.committed=true;save();closeModal();filters={q:'',type:'',status:'',series:'',from:'',to:''};navigate('query');toast(`已${b.dataset.draft==='true'?'保存':'提交'} ${ps.length} 条申报`);}
 else if(a==='new-issue')newIssueModal(id);else if(a==='create-issue'){const i=createIssue(state,$$('input[name="issueProduct"]:checked').map(x=>x.value),$('#f-issueTitle').value);save();closeModal();navigate('issue/'+i.id);toast('发行已创建');}
 else if(a==='generate-material'){const i=state.issues.find(i=>i.id===id);if(i.productIds.some(id=>!eligible(state.products.find(p=>p.id===id))))throw Error('产品尚未满足材料生成条件');if(i.material){showModal('重新生成发行通知','重新生成会覆盖当前通知内容，保留海报设置，并需要重新确认全部材料。',btn('取消','close-modal')+btn('重新生成','confirm-generate','primary','',`data-id="${id}"`));}else{i.material=generatedNotice(i);i.confirmed=false;i.history.unshift({time:now(),action:'生成发行通知',note:'按模板带入已校验说明书要素及附件清单'});save();render();toast('已生成发行通知，可继续编辑通知或制作海报');}}
 else if(a==='confirm-generate'){const i=state.issues.find(i=>i.id===id);i.material=generatedNotice(i);i.confirmed=false;i.history.unshift({time:now(),action:'重新生成发行通知',note:'原确认状态已清除，海报设置保留'});save();closeModal();render();}
 else if(a==='save-material'){const i=state.issues.find(i=>i.id===id);if($('#materialEditor')){if(!$('#materialEditor').value.trim())throw Error('通知内容不能为空');i.material=$('#materialEditor').value;}i.confirmed=false;i.history.unshift({time:now(),action:'保存材料修改',note:'请重新核对并确认材料'});save();render();toast('修改已保存，请重新确认材料');}
 else if(a==='material-tab')materialTab(value);
 else if(a==='send-issue'){const i=state.issues.find(i=>i.id===id);assertNoticeReady(state,i);const noticeSnapshot=i.notice?noticeDocument(i):null;const posterSnapshot=buildPosterModel(state,i);sendIssue(state,id,$$('input[name="recipient"]:checked').map(x=>x.value),{simulateFailure:false});i.posterSnapshot=posterSnapshot;if(noticeSnapshot)i.noticeSnapshot=noticeSnapshot;save();render();toast(`已完成下发，${i.recipients.filter(r=>r.status==='sent').length} 家成功`);}
 else if(a==='retry-issue'){const i=state.issues.find(i=>i.id===id);const failed=i.recipients.filter(r=>r.status==='failed');failed.forEach(r=>{r.status='sent';r.attempts++;r.time=now();});i.history.unshift({time:now(),action:'重新下发',note:`${failed.length} 家失败分行重试成功`});save();render();toast('失败分行已重试成功');}
 else if(a==='original-prospectus'){const p=state.products.find(p=>p.id===id);openOriginal(p).catch(error=>toast(error.message,true));}
 else if(a==='prospectus'){const p=state.products.find(p=>p.id===id);showModal('说明书回传要素',prospectusHTML(p),btn('关闭','close-modal')+btn('下载','download-prospectus','','download',`data-id="${id}"`),true);}
 else if(a==='download-prospectus'){const p=state.products.find(p=>p.id===id);downloadBlob(p.name+'_说明书.html',standaloneDoc('产品说明书',prospectusHTML(p)),'text/html;charset=utf-8');}
 else if(a==='download-notice'){const i=state.issues.find(i=>i.id===id);downloadNotice(i).catch(err=>toast(err.message,true));}
 else if(a==='backup')downloadBlob('存款经营平台_业务记录.json',JSON.stringify(state,null,2),'application/json');
 else if(a==='reset-confirm')showModal('重置初始数据','重置将清除当前浏览器中的新增申报及办理记录，并恢复初始数据。可先在使用帮助中导出记录。',btn('取消','close-modal')+btn('确认重置','reset','primary'));
 else if(a==='reset'){state=seed();ensureAdditionalProducts(state);save();closeModal();formDirty=false;filters={q:'',type:'',status:'',series:'',from:'',to:''};navigate('workbench');toast('已恢复初始数据');}
 else if(a==='export-query'){const ps=state.products.filter(p=>(!filters.q||`${p.name} ${p.id} ${p.marketNumber||''}`.toLowerCase().includes(filters.q.toLowerCase()))&&(!filters.type||p.type===filters.type)&&(!filters.status||p.status===filters.status)&&(!filters.series||p.seriesId===filters.series)&&(!filters.from||p.created.slice(0,10)>=filters.from)&&(!filters.to||p.created.slice(0,10)<=filters.to));workbookDownload([['申报编号','产品名称','类型','滚存系列','期次','申报状态','期限（天）','最近更新'],...ps.map(p=>[p.id,p.name,p.type==='rolling'?'滚存':'普通',p.seriesId,p.period,STATUS[p.status],p.tenor,p.updated])],'申报查询结果.xlsx');}
}catch(err){toast(err.message,true);}});
document.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();if(e.target.id==='queryForm'){const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target));if(data.from&&data.to&&data.from>data.to){toast('开始日期不能晚于结束日期',true);return;}filters={q:'',type:'',status:'',series:'',from:'',to:'',...data};pageNum=1;render();}});
document.addEventListener('change',e=>{const t=e.target;if(t.id==='roleSelect'){role=t.value;sessionStorage.setItem('deposit-demo-role',role);detailTab='elements';formDirty=false;pageNum=1;navigate(role==='branch'?'issuance':'workbench');toast(`已切换至${ROLES[role]}`);}else if(t.id==='branchSelect'){branch=t.value;sessionStorage.setItem('deposit-demo-branch',branch);render();}else if(t.id==='importFile'&&t.files[0])parseFile(t.files[0]);else if(t.id==='f-seriesId'){const s=state.series.find(s=>s.id===t.value);if(s){for(const k of COMMON_KEYS)$('#f-'+k).value=s[k];$('#f-period').value=Math.max(0,...state.products.filter(p=>p.seriesId===s.id).map(p=>Number(p.period)))+1;}}else if(t.id==='f-value'||t.id==='f-maturity'){const a=$('#f-value').value,b=$('#f-maturity').value;if(dateValid(a)&&dateValid(b))$('#f-tenor').value=days(a,b);}else if(t.id==='materialConfirmed'){const i=state.issues.find(i=>i.id===route()[1]);if($('#materialEditor'))i.material=$('#materialEditor').value;if(!i.material.trim()){toast('通知内容不能为空',true);t.checked=false;return;}if(t.checked){try{assertNoticeReady(state,i);buildPosterModel(state,i);}catch(err){toast(err.message,true);t.checked=false;i.confirmed=false;save();return;}}i.confirmed=t.checked;if(t.checked)i.history.unshift({time:now(),action:'确认发行材料',note:'已核对通知、说明书及海报'});save();$('[data-action="send-issue"]').disabled=!t.checked;}});
document.addEventListener('input',e=>{if(e.target.closest('#productForm'))formDirty=true;if(e.target.id==='materialEditor'){const i=state.issues.find(i=>i.id===route()[1]);i.material=e.target.value;i.confirmed=false;save();$('#materialConfirmed').checked=false;$('[data-action="send-issue"]').disabled=true;}});
document.addEventListener('dragover',e=>{if(e.target.closest('.upload-zone'))e.preventDefault();});document.addEventListener('drop',e=>{if(e.target.closest('.upload-zone')){e.preventDefault();if(e.dataTransfer.files[0])parseFile(e.dataTransfer.files[0]);}});
window.addEventListener('beforeunload',e=>{if(formDirty){e.preventDefault();e.returnValue='';}});
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const a=e.target.closest('a[href^="#"]');if(a&&formDirty){e.preventDefault();const target=a.hash.slice(1);showModal('离开未保存的申报','当前表单尚未保存。离开后本次修改将丢失。',btn('继续填写','close-modal')+`<button class="btn primary" id="discardForm">放弃修改并离开</button>`);$('#discardForm').onclick=()=>{closeModal();navigate(target);};}},true);
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{pageNum=1;formDirty=false;detailTab='elements';filters={q:'',type:'',status:'',series:'',from:'',to:''};render();window.scrollTo(0,0);});
save();render();

async function openOriginal(p){if(!p?.prospectusSource)throw Error('尚未关联说明书原件');const view=window.open('about:blank','_blank');if(view)view.opener=null;try{const stored=await originalFile(p.prospectusSource.id);if(!stored){view?.close();throw Error('当前浏览器未保存此原件，请在接收回传的浏览器查看');}const url=URL.createObjectURL(stored.blob);if(view)view.location=url;else downloadBlob(stored.name,stored.blob,stored.blob.type);setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),300000);}catch(error){view?.close();throw error;}}
